cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: stlextractor
abstract: >-
  MATLAB package to process a large STL file containing a packing of
  hexagonal prisms and extract each prism's geometric parameters (radius,
  axis, volume, etc.).
authors:
  - family-names: Fortkamp
    given-names: "Fábio Pinto"
    email: fabio@fabiofortkamp.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/cmt-dtu-energy/stlextractor"
version: 0.15.0
# NOTE (added while resolving issue #20): `version` matches the current
